#: config.yaml:0 content/_index.md:0
msgid "End of 10"
msgstr "10 ning tugashi"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Windows 10 ends in 2025. Don’t buy a new PC — revive yours with Linux. It's "
"fast, secure, and help is available to get you started."
msgstr ""
"Windows 10 2025-yilda yakunlanadi. Yangi kompyuter sotib olmang — eski "
"kompyuteringizni Linux bilan qayta jonlantiring. U tez, xavfsiz va "
"boshlashingiz uchun yordam mavjud."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "/laptop-thumbnail.png"
msgstr "/laptop-thumbnail.png"

#: content/_index.md:8
msgid "Use your old computer but with fresh new software."
msgstr ""
"Eski kompyuteringizni yangi, zamonaviy dasturiy ta'minot bilan ishlating."

#: content/_index.md:10
msgid "Support for Windows 10 ends on October 14, 2025."
msgstr "Windows 10-ni qo‘llab-quvvatlash 2025-yil 14-oktabrda tugaydi."

#: content/_index.md:12
msgid "Microsoft wants you to buy a new computer."
msgstr "Microsoft sizdan yangi kompyuter sotib olishingizni xohlaydi."

#: content/_index.md:14
msgid "But what if you could make your current one fast and secure again?"
msgstr "Ammo agar siz hozirgisini tezroq va xavfsizroq qila olsangizchi?"

#: content/_index.md:18
msgid ""
"If you bought your computer after 2010, there's most likely no reason to "
"throw it out. By just installing an up-to-date Linux operating system you "
"can keep using it for years to come."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz kompyuteringizni 2010 yildan keyin sotib olgan bo'lsangiz, uni "
"tashlab yuborishga hech qanday sabab yo'q. Eng so'nggi Linux operatsion "
"tizimini o'rnatish orqali siz undan ko'p yillar davomida foydalanishda davom "
"etishingiz mumkin."

#: content/_index.md:22
msgid ""
"Installing an operating system may sound difficult, but you don't have to do "
"it alone. With any luck, there are people in your area ready to help!"
msgstr ""
"Operatsion tizimni o'rnatish qiyin tuyulishi mumkin, lekin buni yolg'iz "
"bajarishingiz shart emas. Omad bo‘lsa,, sizning hududingizda yordam berishga "
"tayyor odamlar bor!"

#: content/_index.md:28
msgid "Find someone to help&nbsp;you"
msgstr "Sizga&nbsp;yordam beradigan odamni toping"

#: content/_index.md:32
msgid "[Install Linux yourself →](/install)"
msgstr "[Linuxni o'zingiz o'rnating →](/install)"

#: content/_index.md:36
msgid ""
"Would you like to help others keep their computer alive after "
"Windows&nbsp;10?"
msgstr ""
"Windows&nbsp;10 dan keyin boshqalarga kompyuterlarini saqlab qolishlariga "
"yordam berishni xohlaysizmi?"

#: content/_index.md:40
msgid "Sign up as repair collective"
msgstr "Tuzatish jamoasi sifatida ro'yxatdan o'ting"

#: content/_index.md:48
msgid "**5 Reasons** to upgrade your old computer to Linux"
msgstr "Eski kompyuteringizni Linuxga yangilash uchun **5 ta sabab**"

#: content/_index.md:50 content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:38
msgid ""
"**No New Hardware, No Licensing Costs**{{< br >}} A new laptop costs a lot "
"of money, but several Linux operating systems are available for free. "
"Software updates are also free, forever. You can of course show your support "
"with donations!"
msgstr ""
"**Yangi uskuna yo‘q, litsenziya xarajatlari yo‘q**{{< br >}} Yangi noutbuk "
"katta pul turadi, lekin bir nechta Linux operatsion tizimlari bepul mavjud. "
"Dasturiy ta'minot yangilanishlari ham doimiy va bepul. Albatta, siz xayriya "
"orqali qo‘llab-quvvatlashingiz mumkin!"

#: content/_index.md:54 content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:42
msgid ""
"**Enhanced Privacy**{{< br >}} Windows comes with lots of ads and spyware. "
"This slows down your computer, lets companies spy on you, and increases your "
"energy bills."
msgstr ""
"**Kengaytirilgan maxfiylik**{{< br >}} Windows ko'plab reklamalar va "
"josuslik dasturlari bilan birga keladi. Bu sizning kompyuteringizni "
"sekinlashtiradi, kompaniyalarga sizni josuslik qilishga imkon beradi va "
"energiya to'lovlarini oshiradi."

#: content/_index.md:57 content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:45
msgid ""
"**Good For The Planet**{{< br >}} Production of a computer accounts for 75+% "
"of carbon emissions over its lifecycle. Keeping a functioning device longer "
"is a hugely effective way to reduce emissions. With a Linux operating system "
"you can use your device longer."
msgstr ""
"**Sayyoramiz uchun foydali**{{< br >}} Kompyuter ishlab chiqarish uning "
"hayoti davomidagi uglerod chiqindilarining 75+%ini tashkil qiladi. "
"Ishlaydigan qurilmani uzoqroq saqlash - bu chiqindilarni kamaytirishning "
"juda samarali usuli."

#: content/_index.md:61 content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:49
msgid ""
"**Community & Professional Support**{{< br >}} There are local repair cafes "
"and independent, professional services and computer shops available for "
"providing you help. You can find support in online forums, too."
msgstr ""
"**Hamjamiyat yordami**{{< br >}} Agar kompyuteringiz bilan bog‘liq muammolar "
"bo‘lsa, mahalliy ta’mirlash kafesi va mustaqil kompyuter do‘koni siz uchun. "
"Siz hamjamiyat yordamini onlayn forumlarda topishingiz mumkin."

#: content/_index.md:65 content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:53
msgid ""
"**Better User Control**{{< br >}} Linux grants you the four freedoms of "
"software. You are free to use, study, share, and improve the program, for as "
"long as you wish. You are in control of your device."
msgstr ""
"**Yaxshiroq foydalanuvchi nazorati**{{< br >}} Linux sizga dasturiy "
"ta'minotning to'rtta erkinligini beradi. Siz xohlagancha dasturdan "
"foydalanishingiz, o'rganishingiz, baham ko'rishingiz va yaxshilashingiz "
"mumkin. Qurilmangizni siz nazorat qilasiz."

