#: content/install.md:9
msgid ""
"We recommend getting in-person support for the best experience. However, if "
"you feel you're technically versed enough to do it yourself, here's a "
"general guide with the three main steps needed to install Linux."
msgstr ""
"Eng yaxshi tajriba uchun biz yuzma-yuz yordam olishni tavsiya qilamiz. "
"Biroq, agar siz o'zingizni texnik jihatdan yetarlicha tajribaga egaman deb "
"hisoblaysiz va buni o‘zingiz bajarmoqchi bo‘lsangiz, Linux o‘rnatish uchun "
"kerak bo‘ladigan uchta asosiy bosqichdan iborat umumiy qo‘llanmani taqdim "
"etamiz."

#: content/install.md:14
msgid ""
"Once you have picked a distribution, their website will have more detailed "
"guides you can follow."
msgstr ""
"Biror distribusiyani tanlaganingizdan so‘ng, ularning rasmiy veb-saytida siz "
"amal qilishingiz mumkin bo‘lgan batafsil qo‘llanmalar bo‘ladi."

#: content/install.md:19
msgid ""
"Before you start, make sure to back up any important data from the computer "
"you're about to reinstall!"
msgstr ""
"Ishni boshlashdan oldin, qayta o'rnatmoqchi bo'lgan kompyuteringizdagi "
"barcha muhim ma'lumotlarning zaxira nusxasini yaratganingizga ishonch hosil "
"qiling!"

#: content/install.md:24
msgid ""
"**Download a new OS**{{< br >}} Download the operating system you want to "
"install. Search for Linux distributions for beginners to get some "
"suggestions."
msgstr ""
"**Yangi operatsion tizimni yuklab oling**{{< br >}} Oʻrnatmoqchi boʻlgan "
"operatsion tizimni yuklab oling. Yangi boshlanuvchilar uchun ba'zi "
"takliflarni olish uchun Linux distributivlarini qidiring."

#: content/install.md:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Flash to a USB key**{{< br >}} Flash the operating system to a USB stick "
"using a standard tool, such as Rufus. This will overwrite all data on the "
"USB stick, so make sure to back up the files you want to keep. {{< "
"buttonLink href=\"https://rufus.ie/en/\" class=\"btn_small btn_mt\" target="
"\"_blank\" >}}Get Rufus{{< /buttonLink >}}"
msgstr ""
"**USB kalitiga ko‘chirish**{{< br >}} Rufus kabi standart asbob yordamida "
"operatsion tizimni USB flesh-diskga o‘rnating. Bu USB flesh-diskidagi barcha "
"ma'lumotlarni qayta yozadi, shuning uchun saqlamoqchi bo'lgan fayllarni "
"zaxiralashni unutmang. {{< br >}} {{< buttonLink href=\"https://rufus.ie/en/"
"\" class=\"btn_small btn_mt\" target=\"_blank\" >}}Rufusni olish →{{< /"
"buttonLink >}}"

#: content/install.md:32
msgid ""
"**Boot and install on your computer**{{< br >}} Boot your computer from your "
"USB stick. You will need to know the correct keyboard combination "
"beforehand. At this point you will overwrite all data on the computer, so "
"have a back up of the files you want to keep. Follow the instructions, and "
"voilà! Welcome to your new, old computer!"
msgstr ""
"**Kompyuteringizni yuklang va oʻrnating**{{< br >}} Kompyuteringizni USB "
"fleshkadan yuklang. Buning uchun siz to'g'ri klaviatura tugmalari "
"kombinatsiyasini oldindan bilishingiz kerak bo‘ladi. Bu bosqichda "
"kompyuterdagi barcha ma’lumotlar o‘chiriladi, shuning uchun saqlamoqchi "
"bo‘lgan fayllaringizning zaxira nusxasini olib qo‘ying. Ko‘rsatmalarga amal "
"qiling, va voilà! Yangi, eski kompyuteringizga xush kelibsiz!"

