#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:0
msgid "The end (of Windows 10) is nigh!"
msgstr "(Windows 10 ning) Oxiri yaqin!"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:6
msgid ""
"*Today we're launching \"End Of 10\" ([endof10.org](https://endof10.org/)) "
"and bringing Linux to Windows 10 users!*"
msgstr ""
"*Bugun biz “10 ning tugashi” ([endof10.org](https://endof10.org/))ni ishga "
"tushirmoqdamiz va Linuxni Windows 10 foydalanuvchilariga yetkazamiz!*"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:8
msgid ""
"On 14 October 2025, Microsoft will end support for Windows 10. Microsoft "
"will no longer provide updates for the system and this will turn an "
"estimated 200 to 400 million laptops and computers worldwide into security "
"risks and heavily polluting e-waste."
msgstr ""
"2025-yil 14-oktabrda Microsoft Windows 10-ni qo‘llab-quvvatlashni "
"to‘xtatadi. Microsoft endi tizim uchun yangilanishlarni taqdim etmaydi va bu "
"butun dunyo bo‘ylab taxminan 200 dan 400 milliongacha noutbuk va "
"kompyuterlarni xavfsizlik xavfiga va kuchli ifloslantiruvchi elektron "
"chiqindilarga aylantiradi."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:10
msgid "Yours may be one of them."
msgstr "Sizniki ulardan biri bo'lishi mumkin."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:12
#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:9
msgid "<!--more-->\n"
msgstr "<!--batafsil-->\n"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:14
msgid ""
"But what if you could make your current computer fast and secure again so "
"you can continue to use it? There is an alternative to Windows, one that is "
"free, receives regular updates and works on nearly all devices, from most "
"smartphones and routers, to supercomputers that predict the weather and "
"robots on Mars."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz hozirgi kompyuteringizdan foydalanishda davom etishingiz uchun uni "
"yana tez va xavfsiz holatga keltirsangiz olsangizchi? Windows-ga muqobil "
"bo'lib, u bepul, muntazam yangilanishlarni oladi va deyarli barcha "
"qurilmalarda ishlaydi, aksariyat smartfon va routerlardan tortib, Marsdagi "
"ob-havo va robotlarni bashorat qiluvchi superkompyuterlargacha."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:16
msgid ""
"Yes, it's Linux. Linux is extremely flexible and adaptable, and it can work "
"for you too. Linux can run smoothly on your latest laptop and on a machine "
"from 10-20 years ago."
msgstr ""
"Ha, bu Linux. Linux juda moslashuvchan va moslashuvchan va u siz uchun ham "
"ishlashi mumkin. Linux eng so'nggi noutbukingizda va 10-20 yil oldingi "
"mashinada muammosiz ishlay oladi."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:18
msgid ""
"The cheapest and most environmentally-friendly computer is the one you "
"already own."
msgstr ""
"Eng arzon va eng ekologik toza kompyuter bu sizda mavjud bo'lgan "
"kompyuterdir."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:20
msgid ""
"Installing a new operating system may sound difficult, but the community "
"behind the \"End Of 10\" is here to help! In towns and cities around the "
"globe, there are people and places ready to lend you a hand or even install "
"Linux for you. Many more helper groups get added every day."
msgstr ""
"Yangi operatsion tizimni oʻrnatish qiyin boʻlib tuyulishi mumkin, ammo “10 "
"ning tugashi” jamoasi yordam berish uchun shu yerda! Dunyo bo'ylab shahar va "
"shaharchalarda sizga yordam berishga yoki hatto Linuxni o'rnatishga tayyor "
"odamlar va joylar bor. Har kuni yana ko'plab yordamchi guruhlar qo'shiladi."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:22
msgid "Find help near you at our website:"
msgstr "Bizning veb-saytimizda sizga yaqin bo'lgan yordamni toping:"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:24
msgid "https://endof10.org/"
msgstr "https://endof10.org/"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:26
msgid "Why can't I just migrate my current machine to Windows 11?"
msgstr "Nega men hozirgi mashinamni Windows 11 ga o'tkaza olmayman?"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:28
msgid ""
"Because there is a good chance it won't meet the system requirements for "
"Windows 11. There are several reasons for this, but one of the most "
"questionable is that many devices are being rejected for not having a modern "
"security module. From a technical standpoint, that’s hard to justify."
msgstr ""
"Chunki u Windows 11 uchun tizim talablariga javob bermasligi ehtimoli katta. "
"Buning bir qancha sabablari bor, lekin eng shubhalilaridan biri shundaki, "
"ko‘plab qurilmalar zamonaviy xavfsizlik moduliga ega bo‘lmagani uchun rad "
"etilmoqda. Texnik nuqtai nazardan, buni oqlash qiyin."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:30
msgid ""
"Ironically, it just so happens that 14 October is also \"[International E-"
"Waste Day](https://weee-forum.org/iewd-about/)\". Shortly after follows "
"\"[International Repair Day](https://openrepair.org/international-repair-"
"day/)\" on 18 October. You can't make these things up!"
msgstr ""
"Ajablanarlisi shundaki, 14 oktyabr, shuningdek, \"[Xalqaro elektron "
"chiqindilar kuni](https://weee-forum.org/iewd-about/)\". Ko'p o'tmay, 18 "
"oktyabrda \"[Xalqaro ta'mirlash kuni](https://openrepair.org/international-"
"repair-day/)\". Siz bu narsalarni uydira olmaysiz!"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:32
msgid ""
"But Microsoft really wants Windows 10 users to buy new hardware. In fact, "
"the company has [pushed full-screen notifications](https://arstechnica.com/"
"gadgets/2024/11/microsoft-pushes-full-screen-ads-for-copilot-pcs-on-"
"windows-10-users/) onto users' screens encouraging them to do just that — "
"even for computers that are able to upgrade to Windows 11. This means "
"manufacturing and transporting hundreds of millions of new devices, and this "
"is perhaps the biggest waste of all. Hardware production alone consumes "
"copious amounts of energy and has a disproportionate carbon footprint, all "
"of which is for absolutely nothing when a working device lands in the bin."
msgstr ""
"Ammo Microsoft haqiqatan ham Windows 10 foydalanuvchilari yangi apparat "
"sotib olishlarini xohlaydi. Haqiqatan ham, kompaniya [to'liq ekranli "
"bildirishnomalarni] (https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2024/11/microsoft-"
"pushes-full-screen-ads-for-copilot-pcs-on-windows-10-users/) "
"foydalanuvchilarning ekranlariga ularni xuddi shunday qilishga undadi - "
"hatto Windows-ni yangilash uchun ham. Bu degani yuzlab millionlab yangi "
"qurilmalarni tashish va bu, ehtimol, eng katta isrofgarchilikdir. Uskuna "
"ishlab chiqarishning o'zi juda ko'p energiya sarflaydi va nomutanosib "
"uglerod iziga ega, bularning barchasi ishlaydigan qurilma axlat qutisiga "
"tushganda mutlaqo hech narsa emas."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:34
msgid ""
"On the other hand, when you choose Linux, you get everything you could ever "
"want for daily use, and the same machine can be working for decades. Whether "
"you need to work, run a company, stay connected, or relax, the software "
"shipped with Linux is often beautiful, blazing fast, easy to use, and always "
"under your control. Most concerns about Linux are now outdated or unfounded "
"and your system will remain secure well beyond the end of Windows 10 date at "
"no cost."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa tomondan, siz Linuxni tanlaganingizda, siz kundalik foydalanish uchun "
"xohlagan hamma narsani olasiz va bir xil mashina o'nlab yillar davomida "
"ishlashi mumkin. Ishlashingiz, kompaniyani boshqarishingiz, aloqada "
"bo'lishingiz yoki dam olishingiz kerak bo'ladimi, Linux bilan ta'minlangan "
"dasturiy ta'minot ko'pincha chiroyli, tez, ishlatish uchun qulay va har doim "
"sizning nazoratingiz ostidadir. Linux bilan bog'liq ko'plab xavotirlar endi "
"eskirgan yoki asossiz va tizimingiz Windows 10 ning oxiridan keyin ham "
"xavfsiz bo'lib qoladi."

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:36
msgid "The End Of 10 campaign has identified 5 reasons to upgrade to Linux:"
msgstr ""
"10 ning oxiri kampaniyasi Linux-ga yangilash uchun 5 ta sababni aniqladi:"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:57
msgid ""
"If you're a gamer, you might be wondering: Can I still play my games on "
"Linux? Yes, you can, and it has never been easier! Thousands of popular AAA "
"games now run seamlessly on Linux and, in many cases, performance is equal "
"to or even better than on Windows, especially on older hardware."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz o‘yinchi bo‘lsangiz, shunday savol tug‘ilishi mumkin: “Linuxda "
"o‘yinlarimni o‘ynashim mumkinmi?” Ha, mumkin, va hozir bu har qachongidan "
"ham osonroq! Minglab mashhur AAA o'yinlari endi Linuxda uzluksiz ishlaydi va "
"ko'p hollarda unumdorlik Windows bilan teng yoki undan ham yaxshiroq, "
"ayniqsa eski qurilmalarda."

