#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:85
msgid ""
"The End Of 10 campaign started in November 2024 at the South Tyrol Free "
"Software Conference and has been attracting many new contributors since. "
"This campaign is made possible by the enthusiastic contributions of a "
"dedicated team. Learn more about the team at:"
msgstr ""
"10-ning oxiri kampaniyasi 2024-yil noyabr oyida South Tyrol Free Software "
"Conference da boshlandi va shu vaqtdan beri ko‘plab yangi ishtirokchilarni "
"jalb qilmoqda. Ushbu kampaniya fidoyi jamoaning g'ayratli hissasi tufayli "
"amalga oshirildi. Jamoa haqida ko'proq ma'lumot oling:"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:87
msgid "https://endof10.org/team/"
msgstr "https://endof10.org/team/"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:89
msgid ""
"And what if you already purchased a new computer with Windows pre-installed "
"but want to install Linux on it instead? If you prefer using Linux or "
"another OS, you still pay for Windows, even if you don’t use it. That’s "
"unfair and often non-transparent. Refund4Freedom is an initiative from the "
"Free Software Foundation Europe that defends consumers' right to choose "
"their operating system and get refunds for unused pre-installed software — "
"especially Microsoft Windows — on new computers. The Refund4Freedom campaign "
"launches 29 May to help users get refunds for software they don't want. The "
"initiative focuses first on the Italian market, but will be extended to "
"other locations in the near future. Learn more here:"
msgstr ""
"Agar siz allaqachon Windows o'rnatilgan yangi kompyuterni sotib olgan "
"bo'lsangiz, lekin uning o'rniga Linuxni o'rnatmoqchi bo'lsangiz-chi? Agar "
"siz Linux yoki boshqa operatsion tizimdan foydalanishni afzal ko'rsangiz, "
"undan foydalanmasangiz ham, Windows uchun pul to'laysiz. Bu adolatsiz va "
"ko'pincha shaffof emas. Refund4Freedom – Yevropa Free Software Foundation "
"tashabbusi bo‘lib, u iste’molchilarning o‘z operatsion tizimini tanlash va "
"foydalanilmagan, avvaldan o‘rnatilgan dasturiy ta’minot, ayniqsa, Microsoft "
"Windows, yangi kompyuterlarda to‘lovni qaytarish huquqini himoya qiladi. "
"Refund4Freedom kampaniyasi foydalanuvchilarga o'zlari istamagan dasturiy "
"ta'minot uchun to'lovlarni qaytarishga yordam berish uchun 29-may kuni "
"boshlanadi. Tashabbus birinchi navbatda Italiya bozoriga qaratilgan, ammo "
"yaqin kelajakda boshqa joylarga ham kengaytiriladi. Batafsil bu yerda:"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:91
msgid "https://refund4freedom.org/"
msgstr "https://refund4freedom.org/"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Want future hardware to allow you to install any software you want? It's "
"your hardware, after all! Device Neutrality, an initiative also from the "
"Free Software Foundation Europe, aims to enable end-users to bypass "
"gatekeepers to have a non-discriminatory use of software, including Free & "
"Open Source Software, on their devices. Learn more here:"
msgstr ""
"Kelajakda kerakli dasturiy ta'minotni o'rnatishga ruxsat berishni "
"xohlaysizmi? Axir bu sizning apparatingiz! “Device Neutrality”, shuningdek, "
"Yevropa Free Software Foundation tashabbusi bilan yakuniy foydalanuvchilarga "
"oʻz qurilmalarida dasturiy taʼminotdan, jumladan, bepul va ochiq kodli "
"dasturiy taʼminotdan kamsitmasdan foydalanish uchun darvozabonlarni chetlab "
"oʻtishga imkon yaratishga qaratilgan. Batafsil bu yerda:"

#: content/press/2025-05-28-press-release/index.md:95
msgid "https://fsfe.org/activities/deviceneutrality/index"
msgstr "https://fsfe.org/activities/deviceneutrality/index"

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:0
msgid ""
"Ten Days until the End of Windows 10. Sort of. Why Wait, Install Linux Today!"
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:7
msgid ""
"Tuesday 14 October is just ten days away. This means it's the end of free "
"security updates for Windows 10 users. Well, sort of."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:11
msgid ""
"Microsoft has changed its tune several times this year and they are now "
"offering \"free\" extended support for Windows 10 for one year until 14 "
"October 2026. These security updates are marketed as being free of charge, "
"but there's a hitch (because of course there is): you need to [link your "
"Windows 10 software to an online Microsoft account](https://www.heise.de/en/"
"news/Microsoft-Windows-10-security-updates-free-of-charge-in-Europe-10670977."
"html), although this option only applies in the [European Economic Area]"
"(https://www.euroconsumers.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/"
"Euroconsumers_vs_Microsoft_092025.pdf). Living elsewhere? Then you [pay]"
"(https://www.theregister.com/2025/09/26/not_in_eu_and_want/) with so-called "
"Microsoft Reward Points or by uploading your data to Microsoft's cloud. Or "
"fork over $30 to Microsoft."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:13
msgid "None of those options are really free, are they?"
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:15
msgid ""
"The good news is that the End Of 10 campaign does not need to end either, "
"not yet! For those Windows 10 users who haven't already, there's time to do "
"the last Windows update in your life — upgrade to Linux!"
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:17
msgid ""
"If you make the change now you won't need to link your computer to a "
"Microsoft account, pay Reward Points, upload your private data to corporate "
"servers, or waste your hard-earned money on unnecessary fees."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:19
msgid ""
"Find out what [free as in freedom](https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.en."
"html) is really like with Free & Open Source Software. No licensing costs "
"for software updates or new features. No online account required to use your "
"device. No genAI bundled with your operating system. Your operating system "
"is more private, by default. You decide when to update and restart your "
"computer. You get software updates for as long as you need, or until your "
"hardware breaks. And much more! This is what software freedom looks like."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:21
msgid ""
"As a spokesperson from Germany's [Federal Office for Information Security]"
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federal_Office_for_Information_Security) "
"(BSI) [said](https://www.heise.de/en/news/Microsoft-Windows-10-security-"
"updates-free-of-charge-in-Europe-10670977.html): \"This [extension] gives "
"users a little more time to endeavor to use an operating system that is "
"supplied with security updates in the long term\"."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:23
msgid "Well said, we couldn't agree more!"
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:25
msgid ""
"At the End Of 10 campaign website, you will find places and events near you "
"where people will help you get started using a modern, feature-rich, and "
"independent operating system which is supplied with security updates in the "
"long term: Linux."
msgstr ""

#: content/press/2025-10-04-extended-campaign/index.md:27
msgid "Find someone to help you install Linux today: <https://endof10.org/>"
msgstr ""

