#~ msgid "Why isn't \\<INSERT FAVORITE DISTRO\\> promoted on the website?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nima uchun \\<SEVIMLI DISTRONI KIRITISH\\> veb-saytda targ'ib qilinmaydi?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The End Of 10 website and outreach are intentionally distro-agnostic. The "
#~ "goal is to speak as a big FOSS family. We want the campaign and "
#~ "activities to represent all of our communities."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"10 ning tugashi\" sayti va targ‘iboti ataylab distroga bog‘lanmagan. "
#~ "Maqsad – katta FOSS oilasi sifatida gaplashishdir. Biz kampaniya va "
#~ "faoliyatlarimiz barcha hamjamiyatlarimizni ifodalashini xohlaymiz."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Does distro-agnostic mean FOSS communities cannot promote their own work?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Distro-agnostic degani FOSS hamjamiyatlari o‘z ishlarini targ‘ib qila "
#~ "olmaydi deganimi?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Individual FOSS communities are welcome to promote their own work in the "
#~ "context of the campaign, with two caveats: (i) it must be clear you are "
#~ "speaking for your community and not the campaign, and (ii) you must not "
#~ "speak negatively about the work of other communities."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Alohida FOSS hamjamiyatlari kampaniya kontekstida o'z ishlarini targ'ib "
#~ "qilishlari mumkin, ikkita ogohlantirish bilan: (i) siz kampaniya uchun "
#~ "emas, balki o'z jamoangiz nomidan gapirayotganingiz aniq bo'lishi kerak "
#~ "va (ii) boshqa hamjamiyatlar ishi haqida salbiy gapirmasligingiz kerak."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "For example, one of the planned activities is a \"Lists of 10\" social "
#~ "media campaign with the hashtag `#EndOf10`. In this context:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Masalan, rejalashtirilgan tadbirlardan biri `#EndOf10` xeshtegi bilan "
#~ "\"10 ning ro'yxatlari\" ijtimoiy media kampaniyasidir. Shu nuqtai "
#~ "nazardan:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The official End Of 10 social media account remains as neutral as "
#~ "possible (e.g., \"10 reasons to switch to Linux\") and does not promote "
#~ "any specific distro."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Rasmiy End Of 10 ijtimoiy tarmoq hisobi imkon qadar neytral boʻlib qoladi "
#~ "(masalan, “Linux’ga oʻtish uchun 10 ta sabab”) va hech qanday maxsus "
#~ "distro tarqatishni targʻib qilmaydi."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your community does outreach on social media with a \"10 reasons to "
#~ "switch to \\<YOUR PROJECT\\>\" with the `#EndOf10` hashtag. In the list "
#~ "of reasons you promote your own work. However, it would be unacceptable "
#~ "to speak negatively about any other FOSS community's work."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sizning hamjamiyatingiz ijtimoiy tarmoqlarda #EndOf10 xeshtegi bilan "
#~ "\"\\<LOYIHANGIZ\\> ga o‘tish uchun 10 sabab\" degan mavzuda targ‘ibot "
#~ "olib boradi. Bu sabablar ro‘yxatida o‘z ishingizni targ‘ib qilishingiz "
#~ "mumkin. Biroq, boshqa biror FOSS  hamjamiyatining ishini salbiy tarzda "
#~ "tilga olish mutlaqo maqbul emas."
